  "$comment": [
    "The regions the visual gate (scripts/visual.mjs, JN14) compares. A region names a CSS",
    "selector in the reference page (design/<page>.html, which stays byte for byte the",
    "canvas's) and is found on the site by data-design=\"<name>\". tier \"pixels\" compares",
    "the element's screenshot; \"layout\" compares its box and computed style. A region is",
    "checked only once \"enforced\" is true: the task named in \"task\" turns it on in the",
    "commit that builds it, and a region that is enforced and missing on the site fails."
  ],
